  <title>SET MULTILOCKS Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET MULTILOCKS command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET MULTILOCKS Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">Specifies whether multiple records can be locked at the same time.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET MULTILOCKS ON | OFF | &amp;&lt;cMacro&gt;</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">ON | OFF<tab/>ON allows locking more than one record. OFF allows locking only one record at a time. The value may also be a macro (&amp;) that evaluates to ON or OFF.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Remarks</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">The setting is stored in the runtime state, but the runtime does not use it at this moment.</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_LOCK">SET LOCK</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_EXCLUSIVE">SET EXCLUSIVE</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
